#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:2
msgid "运行工作流"
msgstr "Run workflow"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:4
msgid ""
"本章节介绍在 DaoAI 天眼系统中，如何以不同方式部署与运行工作流，覆盖在线实时、批处理、HTTP API 调用与边缘/本地部署等典型场景。"
msgstr ""
"This chapter introduces how to deploy and run workflows in different ways in"
" the DaoAI Video Analysis Platform, covering typical scenarios such as online real-"
"time, batch processing, HTTP API calls, and edge/local deployment."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:12
msgid "在平台中直接运行"
msgstr "Run directly in the platform"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:14
msgid "最简单的方式是在平台的工作流界面直接运行："
msgstr ""
"The simplest way is to run it directly in the platform's workflow interface:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:16
msgid "进入 ``工作流``，选择或创建一个工作流。"
msgstr "Go to ``Workflow`` and select or create a workflow."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:17
msgid "在编辑画布中点击右上角的“运行 / 测试”，按提示上传图片。"
msgstr ""
"Click \"Run/Test\" in the upper right corner of the editing canvas and "
"follow the prompts to upload images."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:18
msgid "在右侧“输出”面板中查看可视化结果与执行状态。"
msgstr ""
"View the visualization results and execution status in the \"Output\" panel "
"on the right."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:20
msgid "Workflow Result"
msgstr "Workflow Result"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:24
msgid "适用场景：快速验证流程、演示与调参；无需额外集成代码。"
msgstr ""
"Applicable scenarios: rapid verification process, demonstration and "
"parameter adjustment; no additional integration code is required."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:28
msgid "通过相机运行（实时监控与告警）"
msgstr "Run through camera (real-time monitoring and alarm)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:30
msgid "按照以下步骤，将相机接入并实时运行工作流："
msgstr ""
"Follow these steps to plug in your camera and run your workflow in real "
"time:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:32
msgid "Camera Input"
msgstr "Camera Input"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:36
msgid "在主页顶部导航栏，点击 **“摄像头输入”** 进入相机管理页面。"
msgstr ""
"In the navigation bar at the top of the home page, click **\"Camera "
"Input\"** to enter the camera management page."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:37
msgid "点击 **“新增摄像头”**，填写："
msgstr "Click **\"Add Camera\"** and fill in:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:38
msgid "相机名称；"
msgstr "Camera name;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:39
msgid "RTSP 视频流地址；"
msgstr "RTSP video stream address;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:40
msgid "视频解码设备（CPU / GPU）：默认使用 CPU 解码，原因是部分场景下 GPU 资源有限，且可能与模型推理产生资源竞争。"
msgstr ""
"Video decoding device (CPU/GPU): CPU decoding is used by default because GPU"
" resources are limited in some scenarios and may compete with model "
"inference for resources."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:41
msgid "选择一个要运行的工作流；"
msgstr "Select a workflow to run;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:42
msgid "配置 FPS 参数（每秒检测次数）。"
msgstr "Configure FPS parameters (detections per second)."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:43
msgid "保存后，点击 **“运行相机”** 启动实时推理。"
msgstr "After saving, click \"Run Camera\" to start real-time inference."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:45
msgid "在实时展示与告警页面："
msgstr "On the real-time display and alarm page:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:46
msgid "Realtime Dashboard"
msgstr "Realtime Dashboard"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:50
msgid "进入主页顶部导航栏的 **“实时警报”** 页面。"
msgstr ""
"Go to the **Live Alerts** page in the top navigation bar of the home page."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:51
msgid "点击下方的 **管理推流** 按钮，选择刚才已运行的相机。"
msgstr ""
"Click the **Manage Push** button below and select the camera you just ran."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:52
msgid "在监控大屏即可看到实时画面与事件；支持添加多个相机并切换 **4 分屏** 、 **9 分屏** 等多视角布局。"
msgstr ""
"You can see real-time images and events on the large surveillance screen; it"
" supports adding multiple cameras and switching between **4 split screen**, "
"**9 split screen** and other multi-view layouts."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:54
msgid "页面信息布局说明："
msgstr "Page information layout description:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:56
msgid "左侧显示 **按日/按周的事件分析图（daily / weekly event analysis graph）**；"
msgstr "The left side displays **daily/weekly event analysis graph**;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:57
msgid "右侧显示 **实时事件列表（real-time event list）**，可及时查看告警条目与状态。"
msgstr ""
"The right side displays **real-time event list**, where you can view alarm "
"entries and status in real time."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:61
msgid "HTTP API 调用（系统内置 REST 接口）"
msgstr "HTTP API call (system built-in REST interface)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:63
msgid "对于需要从外部系统触发工作流的场景，可通过平台提供的 HTTP API 调用已保存的工作流。"
msgstr ""
"For scenarios where workflows need to be triggered from external systems, "
"saved workflows can be called through the HTTP API provided by the platform."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:65
msgid "参考接口文档："
msgstr "Reference interface documentation:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:67
msgid "``http://<服务器IP>:38080/docs``"
msgstr "``http://<server IP>:38080/docs``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:71
msgid ""
"该 API 不仅支持触发并运行工作流，还提供与天眼后台交互的一系列能力（如工作流管理、相机管理、运行状态查询等）。更多端点与示例请参见完整文档。"
msgstr ""
"This API not only supports triggering and running workflows, but also "
"provides a series of capabilities for interacting with the Tianyan backend "
"(such as workflow management, camera management, running status query, "
"etc.).See the full documentation for more endpoints and examples."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:73
msgid "调用步骤："
msgstr "Calling steps:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:75
msgid "在 DaoAI 天眼系统中保存工作流后，记录其 ``workflow_id``（打开工作流，在浏览器地址栏即可查看并获取）。"
msgstr ""
"After saving the workflow in the DaoAI Tianyan system, record its "
"``workflow_id`` (open the workflow and view and obtain it in the browser "
"address bar)."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:76
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"使用 HTTP 客户端（cURL、Postman、后端服务）向 ``POST /workflows/{workflow_id}/run`` "
"接口发起请求。"
msgstr ""
"Use an HTTP client (cURL, Postman, backend service) to make a request to the"
" ``POST /workflows/{workflow_id}/run`` interface."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:77
msgid ""
"根据接口规范，使用 ``multipart/form-data`` 上传请求体，其中： - "
"``input_image``：二进制图片文件（``string($binary)``）； - "
"``test_definition``：工作流测试定义（字符串），用于指定本次运行的输入映射或参数。"
msgstr ""
"According to the interface specification, use ``multipart/form-data`` to "
"upload the request body, where: - ``input_image``: binary image file "
"(``string($binary)``); - ``test_definition``: workflow test definition "
"(string), used to specify the input mapping or parameters of this run."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:81
msgid "请求示例（multipart/form-data；请按实际接口文档调整字段与鉴权方式）："
msgstr ""
"Request example (multipart/form-data; please adjust fields and "
"authentication methods according to the actual interface document):"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:92
msgid "说明："
msgstr "illustrate:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:94
msgid ""
"若使用 Postman：选择 ``form-data``，``input_image`` 类型设为 File，``test_definition`` "
"类型设为 Text 并填入 JSON 字符串。"
msgstr ""
"If using Postman: Select ``form-data``, set the ``input_image`` type to "
"File, set the ``test_definition`` type to Text and fill in the JSON string."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:96
msgid "返回结果："
msgstr "Return results:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:98
msgid "成功时返回工作流输出字典（例如 JSON 字段、多媒体 URL 等），字段名与工作流定义的 ``outputs`` 对应；"
msgstr ""
"When successful, the workflow output dictionary (such as JSON fields, "
"multimedia URLs, etc.) is returned, and the field names correspond to the "
"``outputs`` defined by the workflow;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:99
msgid "若可视化产生较大图像，建议仅返回 URL（由服务端写入对象存储），以降低响应体积。"
msgstr ""
"If the visualization produces large images, it is recommended to only return"
" the URL (written to the object storage by the server) to reduce the "
"response size."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:103
msgid "调用webRTC"
msgstr "Call webRTC"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:105
msgid ""
"当相机在天眼系统中完成配置并运行后，除了在平台的“实时警报”页面查看画面，还可通过 WebRTC "
"协议在外部系统中订阅并播放这些实时视频流，实现无缝集成与低延迟传输。"
msgstr ""
"After the camera is configured and running in the Video Analysis Platform, in "
"addition to viewing the footage on the platform's \"Real-Time Alert\" page, "
"these real-time video streams can also be subscribed to and played in "
"external systems through the WebRTC protocol to achieve seamless integration"
" and low-latency transmission."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:107
msgid "WebRTC 接入步骤："
msgstr "WebRTC access steps:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:109
msgid "获取摄像头的临时访问 Token（JWT）"
msgstr "Obtain the temporary access token (JWT) of the camera"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:111
#, python-brace-format
msgid "接口：``POST /cameras/{camera_id}/token``"
msgstr "Interface: ``POST /cameras/{camera_id}/token``"

