#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:120
msgid "说明：该 Token 包含房间、发布订阅权限等信息，且有失效时间（exp）。请在 Token 有效期内使用。"
msgstr ""
"Note: This Token contains information such as rooms, publish and subscribe "
"permissions, and has an expiration time (exp).Please use the token within "
"its validity period."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:122
msgid "获取 LiveKit 服务地址（WebSocket 信令）"
msgstr "Get LiveKit service address (WebSocket signaling)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:124
msgid "接口：``GET /livekit-server``"
msgstr "Interface: ``GET /livekit-server``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:127
msgid "``http://<IP>:38080/livekit-server``"
msgstr "``http://<IP>:38080/livekit-server``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:129
msgid "响应：返回用于连接的 WebSocket 地址（例如：``ws://<livekit-host>/ws``）。"
msgstr ""
"Response: Returns the WebSocket address used to connect (for example: "
"``ws://<livekit-host>/ws``)."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:131
msgid "使用 LiveKit 客户端库连接并订阅流"
msgstr "Connect and subscribe to streams using the LiveKit client library"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:133
msgid "使用步骤："
msgstr "Usage steps:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:134
msgid "从步骤 2 取得的 LiveKit 信令地址；"
msgstr "LiveKit signaling address obtained from step 2;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:135
msgid "使用步骤 1 获取的 Token 进行鉴权；"
msgstr "Use the Token obtained in step 1 for authentication;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:136
msgid "连接后订阅对应房间与轨道（tracks），即可接收相机推送的实时视频/音频流。"
msgstr ""
"After connecting, subscribe to the corresponding room and tracks to receive "
"the real-time video/audio stream pushed by the camera."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:138
msgid "参考伪代码（JavaScript，仅示意）："
msgstr "Reference pseudocode (JavaScript, illustration only):"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:159
msgid "Python/Node 等语言均有 LiveKit 客户端实现，可按官方文档选择对应 SDK。"
msgstr ""
"Python/Node and other languages ​​have LiveKit client implementations, and "
"you can select the corresponding SDK according to the official "
"documentation."

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:161
msgid "常见问题与建议"
msgstr "Frequently Asked Questions and Suggestions"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:163
msgid "若无法连接，请检查："
msgstr "If you cannot connect, please check:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:164
msgid "Token 是否仍在有效期内；"
msgstr "Whether the Token is still valid;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:165
msgid "防火墙是否允许 WebSocket 流量；"
msgstr "Whether the firewall allows WebSocket traffic;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:166
msgid "LiveKit 服务地址是否可达；"
msgstr "Whether the LiveKit service address is reachable;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:167
msgid "若画面卡顿："
msgstr "If the screen freezes:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:168
msgid "检查相机运行的 FPS 与网络带宽；"
msgstr "Check the FPS and network bandwidth the camera is running at;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:169
msgid "服务器 GPU/CPU 资源占用情况；"
msgstr "Server GPU/CPU resource usage;"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:170
msgid "安全建议："
msgstr "Safety advice:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/deployment.rst:171
msgid "Token 仅在需要时签发，设定合理的过期时间；"
msgstr ""
"Tokens are only issued when needed and set a reasonable expiration time;"
